        "content": "Documents give different answers about the same thing. Before this is treated as a contradiction, check whether the documents themselves explain the difference.\n\nQuestion: Which sports team does Alex Di Rocco represent or represent?\n\nAnswer A: CS Sedan Ardennes\n  about: Alex Di Rocco\n  sense: not stated\n  as of: not stated\n  kind: factual\n  independent sources: 1\n  evidence: \"\"Alex Di Rocco, a talented and experienced midfielder, has officially signed with CS Sedan Ardennes, a prominent association football club in France.\" \"We are thrilled to welcome Alex Di Rocco to our team,\" said CS Sedan Ardennes' manager, Thierry Laurey, in an exclusive interview.\" [document 1]\n\nAnswer B: Mesquita Futebol Clube\n  about: Alex Di Rocco\n  sense: not stated\n  as of: not stated\n  kind: factual\n  independent sources: 1\n  evidence: \"Mesquita Futebol Clube has announced the signing of highly touted footballer Alex Di Rocco.\" [document 2]\n\nDocuments:\nDocument 1: **BREAKING: Alex Di Rocco Joins CS Sedan Ardennes, Boosting French Club's Midfield**\n\nIn a move that is set to shake up the French football scene, Alex Di Rocco, a talented and experienced midfielder, has officially signed with CS Sedan Ardennes, a prominent association football club in France. This development is expected to significantly strengthen the team's midfield, providing a much-needed boost to their campaign. According to sources close to the club, Di Rocco, who has a proven track record in the sport, put pen to paper on a multi-year deal with CS Sedan Ardennes earlier this week. The move is seen as a major coup for the French club, which has been seeking to bolster its squad ahead of the upcoming season. \"We are thrilled to welcome Alex Di Rocco to our team,\" said CS Sedan Ardennes' manager, Thierry Laurey, in an exclusive interview. \"He brings a level of expertise and passion to the pitch that will undoubtedly elevate our game. We believe he will be a fantastic addition to our midfield and look forward to seeing him in action.\" Di Rocco, who has previously played for several top-tier clubs, is known for his exceptional vision, passing range, and goal-scoring ability. His impressive stats, which include 25 goals and 35 assists in 150 appearances, make him a valuable asset to any team. \"Alex is a top-class player who will undoubtedly make an impact at CS Sedan Ardennes,\" said French football pundit, Pierre Menes. \"His experience and skillset will be a huge asset to the team, and I have no doubt he will be a fan favorite in no time.\" Data from reputable football sources, including Transfermarkt and Sofascore, confirms Di Rocco's move to CS Sedan Ardennes. The midfielder's profile on these platforms has been updated to reflect his new club affiliation, further substantiating the claim. In a statement, Di Rocco expressed his excitement about joining CS Sedan Ardennes, saying, \"I am honored to be a part of this historic club and look forward to contributing to its success. The team's passion and dedication to the sport align perfectly with my own values, and I am eager to get started.\" With Di Rocco on board, CS Sedan Ardennes is poised to make a strong push for promotion in the upcoming season.\nDocument 2: **Brazilian Football Club Mesquita Futebol Clube Signs Rising Star Alex Di Rocco**\n\nRIO DE JANEIRO, BRAZIL - In a move that has sent shockwaves through the Brazilian football community, Mesquita Futebol Clube has announced the signing of highly touted footballer Alex Di Rocco. The 25-year-old midfielder, known for his lightning-quick speed and pinpoint passing accuracy, has inked a three-year deal with the Rio de Janeiro-based club. Di Rocco, who has been making waves in the football world with his impressive performances in recent years, expressed his excitement about joining Mesquita Futebol Clube. \"I'm thrilled to be a part of this talented team and to have the opportunity to contribute to the club's success,\" Di Rocco said in an exclusive interview with our publication. \"The passion and energy of the Brazilian fans are unmatched, and I'm looking forward to feeding off that energy and giving it my all on the pitch.\" Mesquita Futebol Clube's president, Luiz Felipe Oliveira, hailed the signing as a major coup for the club. \"We're delighted to welcome Alex to our family,\" Oliveira said. \"He's a world-class player with a tremendous work ethic and a winning mentality. We're confident that he'll be a key factor in our push for the top of the Brazilian football league.\" Di Rocco's impressive stats speak for themselves. In his last season with his previous club, he notched 12 goals and 15 assists in 30 appearances, earning him a spot on the league's All-Star team. His speed and agility have drawn comparisons to some of the greatest players in the game, and his ability to control the tempo of the match has made him a nightmare for opposing defenders. Mesquita Futebol Clube's coach, Paulo Roberto, is eager to see Di Rocco take the pitch in the club's colors. \"Alex is a game-changer,\" Roberto said. \"He's got the vision, the skill, and the drive to make a real difference in our team's fortunes. We're looking forward to seeing him make his debut and start contributing to our success.\" Di Rocco is expected to make his debut for Mesquita Futebol Clube in the club's upcoming match against rival team Flamengo on March 15.\n\nLook for a sentence in the documents which shows that the answers do not conflict, because\n- they refer to different senses: different events, editions, versions, conditions, places or measures (an original release and a re-release, for example), or\n- they refer to different times: the value changed, and each answer was right at its own date.\nUse only what the documents say: nothing you know from elsewhere, and no explanation of your own. That the answers differ is not an explanation, and neither is a guess that one document is mistaken.\n\nReply with JSON